casmi26 — third-party material

1. prvsiyan, "Analog Propagation CASMI 2026 baseline" (Kaggle notebook,
   kaggle.com/code/prvsiyan/analog-propagation-casmi-2026-baseline), Apache License 2.0.
   - src/casmi/fpmodel.py adapts its FPNet architecture (SinEmb, Block, FPNet) and its
     input preparation (prep_peaks, peak merging, adduct / instrument vocabularies) so
     that the published checkpoints below load unchanged.
   - scripts/fork_prvsiyan.py rebuilds its scored V33 cell, unmodified, as a private kernel.

